1
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:25,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪See the price paid in blood♪</font></font>

2
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:28,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Binding half a lifetime of fate♪</font></font>

3
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:31,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Watch her tear apart with her own hands♪</font></font>

4
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:34,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The cold haze of a humble life♪</font></font>

5
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Trading it for robes of splendor♪</font></font>

6
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Every step is on a blade♪</font></font>

7
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪To the eyes of the world♪</font></font>

8
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:43,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She's a bird, a flower, a plaything♪</font></font>

9
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:46,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪But with one sweep she scatters the clouds♪</font></font>

10
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Till bones and all fade into smoke♪</font></font>

11
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪A game within a game, a fate beyond fate♪</font></font>

12
00:00:55,540 --> 00:01:01,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Who makes the move? Who listens?♪</font></font>

13
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Behind this mask♪</font></font>

14
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:06,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She plays out every soul♪</font></font>

15
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Each encounter and each step fraught with danger♪</font></font>

16
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Set a wild fire ablaze♪</font></font>

17
00:01:11,020 --> 00:01:12,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Burn away these chains♪</font></font>

18
00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Let this frost flower fulfill its fate♪</font></font>

19
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Take a single chess piece♪</font></font>

20
00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And wager heaven and earth♪</font></font>

21
00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Pierce through hypocrisy's false mask♪</font></font>

22
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:24,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Stir up a mighty storm♪</font></font>

23
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Watch her break free and stun the world♪</font></font>

24
00:01:33,140 --> 00:01:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Adapted from the novel Where the Mask Ends on Jinjiang Literature City]</font></font>

25
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Original Author: Xiao Jiaren]</font></font>

26
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Where the Mask Ends]</font></font>

27
00:01:37,980 --> 00:01:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Episode 30]</font></font>

28
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:56,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Baihu Hall]</font></font>

29
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Her Ladyship has a few heartfelt words for you.</font></font>

30
00:02:18,310 --> 00:02:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Listen carefully, General.</font></font>

31
00:02:20,430 --> 00:02:21,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Before entering the palace,</font></font>

32
00:02:21,870 --> 00:02:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she gave the people 200 homing pigeons.</font></font>

33
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You may order your men to shoot them down,</font></font>

34
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but if even one pigeon</font></font>

35
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">makes it out of the city,</font></font>

36
00:02:30,150 --> 00:02:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">war will break out.</font></font>

37
00:02:32,310 --> 00:02:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once word spreads that the Crown Prince killed his father to seize power,</font></font>

38
00:02:35,590 --> 00:02:37,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the regional garrisons and princes</font></font>

39
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will all rise against him.</font></font>

40
00:02:39,190 --> 00:02:40,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How will you withstand them, General Han?</font></font>

41
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you want the Crown Prince to take the throne,</font></font>

42
00:02:43,940 --> 00:02:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you must negotiate with Her Ladyship.</font></font>

43
00:02:46,430 --> 00:02:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's cautious indeed.</font></font>

44
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:50,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She knew this rabble</font></font>

45
00:02:50,530 --> 00:02:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">couldn't keep her alive,</font></font>

46
00:02:52,590 --> 00:02:54,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so she prepared a fallback plan.</font></font>

47
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:55,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Very well.</font></font>

48
00:02:56,430 --> 00:02:58,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll negotiate with her.</font></font>

49
00:02:59,750 --> 00:03:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All of you,</font></font>

50
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">wait outside!</font></font>

51
00:03:23,310 --> 00:03:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I didn't know</font></font>

52
00:03:24,710 --> 00:03:26,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'd just lost your husband,</font></font>

53
00:03:27,190 --> 00:03:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd think</font></font>

54
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:30,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you were about to get married.</font></font>

55
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That outfit</font></font>

56
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is quite dazzling.</font></font>

57
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:38,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't I look beautiful?</font></font>

58
00:03:45,470 --> 00:03:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You do.</font></font>

59
00:03:46,910 --> 00:03:49,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In this lifeless court,</font></font>

60
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:52,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're the most dazzling flower.</font></font>

61
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A pity you're poisonous.</font></font>

62
00:03:59,190 --> 00:04:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's get to the point.</font></font>

63
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're helping the Crown Prince seize the throne.</font></font>

64
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He'll never spare my mother or me.</font></font>

65
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd like to ask you</font></font>

66
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to protect my entire clan.</font></font>

67
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:12,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Liu Shuo</font></font>

68
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has probably been captured by Grand Commandant Zheng.</font></font>

69
00:04:16,430 --> 00:04:19,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You two led troops into the palace at night.</font></font>

70
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:21,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You clearly intended to rebel.</font></font>

71
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Crown Prince will be justified</font></font>

72
00:04:25,270 --> 00:04:26,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in crushing your rebellion and taking the throne.</font></font>

73
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:35,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If we can settle this without bloodshed,</font></font>

74
00:04:35,830 --> 00:04:37,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd rather avoid a massacre.</font></font>

75
00:04:39,430 --> 00:04:40,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now,</font></font>

76
00:04:41,270 --> 00:04:43,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">everyone's life</font></font>

77
00:04:45,950 --> 00:04:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">depends on your decision.</font></font>

78
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you want, General?</font></font>

79
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:01,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You and the Crown Prince are mortal enemies.</font></font>

80
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To save you and your mother,</font></font>

81
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">there's only one way.</font></font>

82
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:11,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You must become my wife.</font></font>

83
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've only just lost my husband,</font></font>

84
00:05:16,070 --> 00:05:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you want me to remarry?</font></font>

85
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Drop the act.</font></font>

86
00:05:21,430 --> 00:05:23,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've seen right through you.</font></font>

87
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:26,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Deep down, you're selfish,</font></font>

88
00:05:27,310 --> 00:05:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">cold-hearted,</font></font>

89
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and ruthless.</font></font>

90
00:05:30,430 --> 00:05:32,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No one wants to rise in the world more than you.</font></font>

91
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:36,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't you marry Lu Zhuo for power?</font></font>

92
00:05:38,190 --> 00:05:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whatever he could give you,</font></font>

93
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can give you too.</font></font>

94
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:47,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've plotted against the Han family several times.</font></font>

95
00:05:48,390 --> 00:05:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We have no shortage of bad blood between us.</font></font>

96
00:05:51,190 --> 00:05:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm afraid you'll break your word</font></font>

97
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and settle the score later.</font></font>

98
00:06:00,070 --> 00:06:02,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Others worship you as a goddess,</font></font>

99
00:06:02,870 --> 00:06:05,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but I want that goddess in my arms.</font></font>

100
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why plot for your brother</font></font>

101
00:06:14,070 --> 00:06:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when you could plot for your own husband?</font></font>

102
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao,</font></font>

103
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm giving you one final chance.</font></font>

104
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Refuse,</font></font>

105
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I'll order everyone in the city killed.</font></font>

106
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:29,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The first to die</font></font>

107
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:33,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will be your own mother.</font></font>

108
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:37,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Think carefully.</font></font>

109
00:06:45,870 --> 00:06:46,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll marry you.</font></font>

110
00:06:49,750 --> 00:06:50,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Really?</font></font>

111
00:06:59,630 --> 00:07:00,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

112
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

113
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You vile woman...</font></font>

114
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Poison!</font></font>

115
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:12,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He knew I kept a blade beneath my pillow.</font></font>

116
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:16,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rather than blame me for it,</font></font>

117
00:07:17,270 --> 00:07:18,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he even gave me this ring.</font></font>

118
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could you ever compare to him?</font></font>

119
00:07:27,190 --> 00:07:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiao!</font></font>

120
00:07:28,310 --> 00:07:29,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now!</font></font>

121
00:07:29,870 --> 00:07:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Noble Lady Wu'an acts on His Majesty's orders to crush the traitors.</font></font>

122
00:07:31,870 --> 00:07:33,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lay down your weapons before the Zi hour,</font></font>

123
00:07:33,390 --> 00:07:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and your part in the rebellion will be pardoned.</font></font>

124
00:07:35,390 --> 00:07:36,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Anyone who continues to side with the rebels</font></font>

125
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will be killed!</font></font>

126
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:42,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness,</font></font>

127
00:07:42,070 --> 00:07:43,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Empress Dowager is confined to Changle Palace for now.</font></font>

128
00:07:45,750 --> 00:07:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness,</font></font>

129
00:07:47,950 --> 00:07:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you mustn't hesitate now.</font></font>

130
00:07:53,190 --> 00:07:53,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Search!</font></font>

131
00:07:54,510 --> 00:07:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Find the Imperial Seal at all costs!</font></font>

132
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:03,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Guard His Majesty.</font></font>

133
00:08:12,830 --> 00:08:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's oil.</font></font>

134
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao, what are you doing?</font></font>

135
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness,</font></font>

136
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you've stormed the palace in the dead of night.</font></font>

137
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What exactly do you intend?</font></font>

138
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To kill the wicked consort and rid Father's court of evil, of course.</font></font>

139
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness, we've searched everywhere.</font></font>

140
00:08:37,710 --> 00:08:38,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's no sign of the seal.</font></font>

141
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:41,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where is it?</font></font>

142
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty is gravely ill</font></font>

143
00:08:43,930 --> 00:08:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and allows only me to attend to him.</font></font>

144
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm the only one</font></font>

145
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who knows where the Imperial Seal is.</font></font>

146
00:08:50,150 --> 00:08:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hand over the seal, and I may leave your corpse intact.</font></font>

147
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to see my daughter.</font></font>

148
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone in my life,</font></font>

149
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:00,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">including my mother,</font></font>

150
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my father,</font></font>

151
00:09:03,390 --> 00:09:04,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and my grandmother,</font></font>

152
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:07,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">had something they wanted,</font></font>

153
00:09:09,150 --> 00:09:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and it always mattered more than I did.</font></font>

154
00:09:22,750 --> 00:09:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Only he was different.</font></font>

155
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He stayed by my side</font></font>

156
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and cared for me.</font></font>

157
00:09:34,910 --> 00:09:37,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even though I pushed him away again and again,</font></font>

158
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he'd always hold me close again,</font></font>

159
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">never caring what it cost him.</font></font>

160
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In this world,</font></font>

161
00:09:52,630 --> 00:09:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he was the only one who put me first.</font></font>

162
00:09:56,150 --> 00:09:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No one could ever replace him.</font></font>

163
00:10:00,790 --> 00:10:01,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you</font></font>

164
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">killed him.</font></font>

165
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How dare you kill my husband?</font></font>

166
00:10:18,670 --> 00:10:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The truth is,</font></font>

167
00:10:23,270 --> 00:10:24,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in life or in death,</font></font>

168
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he belongs to me.</font></font>

169
00:10:34,750 --> 00:10:37,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want this love to last through every lifetime,</font></font>

170
00:10:38,270 --> 00:10:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">never to fade.</font></font>

171
00:10:44,150 --> 00:10:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So why should I fear death?</font></font>

172
00:10:48,630 --> 00:10:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao,</font></font>

173
00:10:51,390 --> 00:10:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">don't...</font></font>

174
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry.</font></font>

175
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once I've killed you,</font></font>

176
00:10:58,390 --> 00:11:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll kill the Crown Prince!</font></font>

177
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Han Liao tried to turn</font></font>

178
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:57,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Zhongkai and me against each other.</font></font>

179
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:59,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I devised a plan to fake my death</font></font>

180
00:11:59,790 --> 00:12:00,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and lure the enemy in.</font></font>

181
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That day in Death Valley,</font></font>

182
00:12:03,510 --> 00:12:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I led my men out along a path on the cliff face</font></font>

183
00:12:06,150 --> 00:12:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and left a body I'd prepared in advance in my place.</font></font>

184
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:12,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General Lu has fallen,</font></font>

185
00:12:12,550 --> 00:12:14,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">taking the Huta soldiers with him!</font></font>

186
00:12:29,670 --> 00:12:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In every lifetime,</font></font>

187
00:12:31,910 --> 00:12:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she will always be my wife.</font></font>

188
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As for you,</font></font>

189
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can go to hell.</font></font>

190
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:03,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness,</font></font>

191
00:13:03,790 --> 00:13:05,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Noble Lady Wu'an is trying to burn General Han alive!</font></font>

192
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:07,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao! My Rao!</font></font>

193
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where is the seal?</font></font>

194
00:13:09,550 --> 00:13:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I swear on my honor as Crown Prince</font></font>

195
00:13:11,270 --> 00:13:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to spare you and your daughter. I'll keep my word!</font></font>

196
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:15,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One last lesson for you.</font></font>

197
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:17,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Break your word,</font></font>

198
00:13:17,630 --> 00:13:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and even if you win the throne,</font></font>

199
00:13:19,790 --> 00:13:20,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you won't keep it.</font></font>

200
00:13:22,630 --> 00:13:23,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The seal is buried</font></font>

201
00:13:23,670 --> 00:13:25,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in the peach grove southeast of Xuanshi Palace.</font></font>

202
00:13:25,910 --> 00:13:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go and dig it up yourself!</font></font>

203
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hurry!</font></font>

204
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao!</font></font>

205
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Find the seal!</font></font>

206
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:30,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

207
00:13:30,710 --> 00:13:31,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Crown Prince gave his word.</font></font>

208
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:32,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- All of you, go! - Rao!</font></font>

209
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I didn't.</font></font>

210
00:13:35,510 --> 00:13:36,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao!</font></font>

211
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao!</font></font>

212
00:13:42,580 --> 00:13:44,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao!</font></font>

213
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:46,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shoot!</font></font>

214
00:13:47,300 --> 00:13:48,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao!</font></font>

215
00:13:50,510 --> 00:13:52,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General Lu!</font></font>

216
00:13:52,180 --> 00:13:53,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao!</font></font>

217
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:54,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mother!</font></font>

218
00:13:59,570 --> 00:14:00,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've followed General Lu's plan</font></font>

219
00:14:01,060 --> 00:14:02,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and secured the Imperial City.</font></font>

220
00:14:02,830 --> 00:14:03,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zheng Tan has been captured.</font></font>

221
00:14:05,590 --> 00:14:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao!</font></font>

222
00:14:13,020 --> 00:14:14,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Seize the rebel leader!</font></font>

223
00:14:14,470 --> 00:14:15,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Charge!</font></font>

224
00:14:23,830 --> 00:14:24,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What did you...</font></font>

225
00:14:26,870 --> 00:14:28,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What did you just call me?</font></font>

226
00:14:29,940 --> 00:14:31,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I heard everything.</font></font>

227
00:14:33,940 --> 00:14:35,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You offered the Imperial Seal</font></font>

228
00:14:36,510 --> 00:14:37,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in exchange for my life.</font></font>

229
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:45,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could the Imperial Seal</font></font>

230
00:14:46,590 --> 00:14:48,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">matter more than my precious daughter?</font></font>

231
00:15:02,940 --> 00:15:03,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everyone, stop!</font></font>

232
00:15:16,110 --> 00:15:16,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aman,</font></font>

233
00:15:18,630 --> 00:15:19,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Shu is gone.</font></font>

234
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:20,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go.</font></font>

235
00:15:22,390 --> 00:15:23,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Find her.</font></font>

236
00:16:04,590 --> 00:16:06,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When the Fourth Prince was brought into the palace,</font></font>

237
00:16:07,180 --> 00:16:09,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I said I wanted to come and have a look too.</font></font>

238
00:16:10,350 --> 00:16:11,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm glad</font></font>

239
00:16:12,140 --> 00:16:13,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I came.</font></font>

240
00:16:15,020 --> 00:16:17,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Make her suffer every punishment</font></font>

241
00:16:18,470 --> 00:16:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she inflicted on those innocent girls</font></font>

242
00:16:23,110 --> 00:16:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">before sending her to the scaffold.</font></font>

243
00:16:32,390 --> 00:16:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let go of me!</font></font>

244
00:16:33,630 --> 00:16:34,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let go!</font></font>

245
00:16:34,710 --> 00:16:35,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm the Crown Princess!</font></font>

246
00:16:35,900 --> 00:16:37,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A lowly woman like you has no right to judge me!</font></font>

247
00:16:38,750 --> 00:16:39,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where's Wei Rao?</font></font>

248
00:16:40,470 --> 00:16:41,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tell her to come and speak to me.</font></font>

249
00:16:43,020 --> 00:16:43,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What?</font></font>

250
00:16:44,350 --> 00:16:45,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is she afraid?</font></font>

251
00:16:46,110 --> 00:16:49,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's because she's a night-soil woman.</font></font>

252
00:16:49,390 --> 00:16:50,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A night-soil woman!</font></font>

253
00:16:53,540 --> 00:16:54,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let go!</font></font>

254
00:16:54,110 --> 00:16:55,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Had my sister been in your place tonight,</font></font>

255
00:16:56,020 --> 00:16:57,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she'd have marched straight into the palace</font></font>

256
00:16:57,500 --> 00:16:59,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and held the Emperor hostage to command the princes.</font></font>

257
00:16:59,940 --> 00:17:01,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But to settle a private grudge,</font></font>

258
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:03,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you went straight to Zhuyu Estate</font></font>

259
00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:05,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and wasted your best chance.</font></font>

260
00:17:06,500 --> 00:17:08,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're too foolish and shortsighted</font></font>

261
00:17:08,870 --> 00:17:11,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to be a worthy opponent for my sister.</font></font>

262
00:17:14,310 --> 00:17:14,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take her away.</font></font>

263
00:17:16,030 --> 00:17:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao!</font></font>

264
00:17:18,660 --> 00:17:20,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come out!</font></font>

265
00:17:25,310 --> 00:17:27,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My voice sounds awful.</font></font>

266
00:17:28,940 --> 00:17:29,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiao,</font></font>

267
00:17:33,550 --> 00:17:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the guilty have been punished,</font></font>

268
00:17:36,460 --> 00:17:37,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and those who died unjustly</font></font>

269
00:17:38,790 --> 00:17:40,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">can finally rest in peace.</font></font>

270
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:41,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They will.</font></font>

271
00:17:42,830 --> 00:17:43,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I wish you, Lady Hongxian,</font></font>

272
00:17:45,070 --> 00:17:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">all the happiness you hope for</font></font>

273
00:17:47,660 --> 00:17:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and a smooth road ahead.</font></font>

274
00:18:01,830 --> 00:18:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was blind drunk last night</font></font>

275
00:18:03,390 --> 00:18:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and couldn't come to your aid in time.</font></font>

276
00:18:04,660 --> 00:18:05,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please forgive me, Father.</font></font>

277
00:18:05,830 --> 00:18:07,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've arrested every member</font></font>

278
00:18:07,550 --> 00:18:08,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of the traitorous Zheng family.</font></font>

279
00:18:09,660 --> 00:18:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Better to arrive late</font></font>

280
00:18:11,830 --> 00:18:13,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">than to join the wrong side.</font></font>

281
00:18:14,070 --> 00:18:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Liu Shou</font></font>

282
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has committed high treason</font></font>

283
00:18:17,070 --> 00:18:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and violated the bonds of family.</font></font>

284
00:18:19,550 --> 00:18:20,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He is stripped of his rank</font></font>

285
00:18:22,500 --> 00:18:23,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and ordered</font></font>

286
00:18:25,790 --> 00:18:26,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to take his own life.</font></font>

287
00:18:28,700 --> 00:18:30,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">On an auspicious day, I shall inform the ancestors</font></font>

288
00:18:31,310 --> 00:18:33,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of the appointment of my fourth son, Liu Shuo,</font></font>

289
00:18:33,350 --> 00:18:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">as heir,</font></font>

290
00:18:34,830 --> 00:18:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to secure the realm.</font></font>

291
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:42,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So that's it.</font></font>

292
00:18:43,700 --> 00:18:46,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You were waiting until Liu Shuo was strong enough</font></font>

293
00:18:46,740 --> 00:18:48,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to inherit the throne</font></font>

294
00:18:48,390 --> 00:18:49,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">before deposing me.</font></font>

295
00:18:50,390 --> 00:18:52,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You foresaw trouble in the palace</font></font>

296
00:18:52,550 --> 00:18:54,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and immediately sent men to protect him.</font></font>

297
00:18:55,350 --> 00:18:56,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">From beginning to end,</font></font>

298
00:18:56,410 --> 00:18:58,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">only Liu Shuo's hands remained clean.</font></font>

299
00:19:00,630 --> 00:19:01,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father,</font></font>

300
00:19:02,590 --> 00:19:04,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how could you be so biased</font></font>

301
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:08,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and so unfair?</font></font>

302
00:19:11,900 --> 00:19:12,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Guards.</font></font>

303
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:26,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Liu Ding,</font></font>

304
00:19:27,740 --> 00:19:29,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if you dare harbor treasonous thoughts,</font></font>

305
00:19:30,870 --> 00:19:32,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">let his fate be a warning.</font></font>

306
00:19:33,870 --> 00:19:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I would never dare, Father!</font></font>

307
00:19:39,140 --> 00:19:39,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao.</font></font>

308
00:19:45,790 --> 00:19:46,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty.</font></font>

309
00:19:47,740 --> 00:19:49,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've seen</font></font>

310
00:19:49,550 --> 00:19:51,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">all that you've done.</font></font>

311
00:19:51,740 --> 00:19:53,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've carried on your father's legacy,</font></font>

312
00:19:54,140 --> 00:19:55,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">stayed true to your country,</font></font>

313
00:19:56,270 --> 00:19:57,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">served its people,</font></font>

314
00:19:58,180 --> 00:19:59,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and remained loyal to your sovereign.</font></font>

315
00:20:00,350 --> 00:20:01,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've quelled the rebellion and protected the throne,</font></font>

316
00:20:02,140 --> 00:20:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">rendering great service to the realm.</font></font>

317
00:20:04,170 --> 00:20:07,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I hereby name you Princess Protector of the Realm</font></font>

318
00:20:07,740 --> 00:20:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and add 5,000 households to your fief.</font></font>

319
00:20:10,630 --> 00:20:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thank Your Majesty for this honor.</font></font>

320
00:20:16,500 --> 00:20:17,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rise.</font></font>

321
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:24,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo.</font></font>

322
00:20:27,790 --> 00:20:28,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty.</font></font>

323
00:20:29,270 --> 00:20:31,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shuo is Wei Rao's brother.</font></font>

324
00:20:32,550 --> 00:20:34,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In the future, don't treat him merely as your sovereign.</font></font>

325
00:20:34,830 --> 00:20:37,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Treat him as your own brother,</font></font>

326
00:20:37,660 --> 00:20:40,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">guiding him whenever he strays and supporting him wholeheartedly.</font></font>

327
00:20:41,350 --> 00:20:43,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I shall do all I can</font></font>

328
00:20:44,660 --> 00:20:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to live up to Your Majesty's trust.</font></font>

329
00:20:55,220 --> 00:20:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father.</font></font>

330
00:21:00,590 --> 00:21:01,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shuo,</font></font>

331
00:21:02,500 --> 00:21:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in three days,</font></font>

332
00:21:04,310 --> 00:21:04,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I shall</font></font>

333
00:21:05,630 --> 00:21:07,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">preside over your coming-of-age ceremony.</font></font>

334
00:21:20,540 --> 00:21:24,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Xuanshi Palace]</font></font>

335
00:21:40,280 --> 00:21:41,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">An emperor's mind</font></font>

336
00:21:42,830 --> 00:21:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is truly unfathomable.</font></font>

337
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:46,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Last night, he wasn't only testing the deposed Crown Prince.</font></font>

338
00:21:48,670 --> 00:21:49,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He was testing you too.</font></font>

339
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:54,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Testing me?</font></font>

340
00:21:57,870 --> 00:21:58,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness,</font></font>

341
00:21:59,630 --> 00:22:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General Lu,</font></font>

342
00:22:03,040 --> 00:22:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">shouldn't you be thanking your matchmaker?</font></font>

343
00:22:05,560 --> 00:22:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you mean?</font></font>

344
00:22:07,110 --> 00:22:08,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The plan was to test your feelings,</font></font>

345
00:22:08,560 --> 00:22:09,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but Lu Zhuo refused to go along with it,</font></font>

346
00:22:10,040 --> 00:22:11,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I gave him a stronger dose</font></font>

347
00:22:11,870 --> 00:22:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and tied up Zhao Song to stop him from sending word.</font></font>

348
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:14,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Otherwise,</font></font>

349
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:16,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how would we have learned your true feelings?</font></font>

350
00:22:16,210 --> 00:22:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

351
00:22:16,690 --> 00:22:17,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo,</font></font>

352
00:22:18,040 --> 00:22:19,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you owe me your thanks.</font></font>

353
00:22:20,040 --> 00:22:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where else could you find</font></font>

354
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:22,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">such a selfless man</font></font>

355
00:22:22,930 --> 00:22:24,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who asks for nothing in return?</font></font>

356
00:22:25,200 --> 00:22:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So that's what happened.</font></font>

357
00:22:29,390 --> 00:22:30,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes,</font></font>

358
00:22:30,590 --> 00:22:31,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I certainly owe you my thanks!</font></font>

359
00:22:31,670 --> 00:22:33,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The general repays kindness with violence!</font></font>

360
00:22:35,040 --> 00:22:35,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness,</font></font>

361
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:37,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">mind your manners.</font></font>

362
00:22:44,320 --> 00:22:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tell me.</font></font>

363
00:22:45,720 --> 00:22:46,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When did you wake up in the coffin?</font></font>

364
00:22:48,520 --> 00:22:49,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just in time</font></font>

365
00:22:49,870 --> 00:22:51,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to hear you say that our bond is unbreakable</font></font>

366
00:22:52,430 --> 00:22:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and that you can't live without me.</font></font>

367
00:22:54,130 --> 00:22:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All right, all right. I was wrong.</font></font>

368
00:23:00,560 --> 00:23:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How can you cast me aside after all I've done?</font></font>

369
00:23:02,150 --> 00:23:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait up!</font></font>

370
00:23:02,640 --> 00:23:03,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know.</font></font>

371
00:23:03,790 --> 00:23:04,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- I was wrong. - Your Majesty,</font></font>

372
00:23:05,200 --> 00:23:06,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why not set state affairs aside for now</font></font>

373
00:23:07,390 --> 00:23:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and go to the retreat palace so you can recover?</font></font>

374
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:09,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

375
00:23:09,910 --> 00:23:10,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Xuanshi Palace]</font></font>

376
00:23:10,830 --> 00:23:11,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I must</font></font>

377
00:23:12,070 --> 00:23:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">see Shuo</font></font>

378
00:23:13,910 --> 00:23:15,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">secure on the throne.</font></font>

379
00:23:16,560 --> 00:23:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Otherwise,</font></font>

380
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't be able to rest in peace.</font></font>

381
00:23:29,150 --> 00:23:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shuo is still young.</font></font>

382
00:23:32,960 --> 00:23:34,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The regional princes</font></font>

383
00:23:34,630 --> 00:23:35,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">won't respect his authority.</font></font>

384
00:23:36,560 --> 00:23:38,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To secure his throne,</font></font>

385
00:23:40,390 --> 00:23:43,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he'll need his sister's standing with the people</font></font>

386
00:23:43,200 --> 00:23:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">as well as</font></font>

387
00:23:45,150 --> 00:23:46,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the support of Lu Zhuo and the others.</font></font>

388
00:24:01,900 --> 00:24:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Xuanshi Palace]</font></font>

389
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:11,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In early summer the following year, the Emperor dies.</font></font>

390
00:24:12,740 --> 00:24:14,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Crown Prince Liu Shuo ascends the throne,</font></font>

391
00:24:15,780 --> 00:24:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">ushering in the Xihe era.</font></font>

392
00:24:18,180 --> 00:24:20,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Xuanshi Palace]</font></font>

393
00:25:00,980 --> 00:25:03,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Duke's Residence]</font></font>

394
00:25:03,300 --> 00:25:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Fourth month of the third year of Xihe]</font></font>

395
00:25:31,860 --> 00:25:36,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Through this endless world, how many times must I wander♪</font></font>

396
00:25:36,940 --> 00:25:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Till all my longing turns into a poem?♪</font></font>

397
00:25:40,870 --> 00:25:41,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To kill at close range,</font></font>

398
00:25:42,280 --> 00:25:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can't rely only on tricks like hidden weapons.</font></font>

399
00:25:45,480 --> 00:25:46,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This move</font></font>

400
00:25:47,150 --> 00:25:48,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is called Redirecting Force.</font></font>

401
00:25:49,380 --> 00:25:54,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Gladly, I linger here with you...♪</font></font>

402
00:25:55,430 --> 00:25:56,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Be serious.</font></font>

403
00:25:56,340 --> 00:26:00,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪You're the hazy moon beyond the clouds...♪</font></font>

404
00:26:04,110 --> 00:26:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like this?</font></font>

405
00:26:09,720 --> 00:26:10,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not showing you.</font></font>

406
00:26:11,590 --> 00:26:12,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You'll only blame me again.</font></font>

407
00:26:13,500 --> 00:26:18,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Even amid flashing blades, I know no fear♪</font></font>

408
00:26:18,860 --> 00:26:22,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪You're the willow mist of spring...♪</font></font>

409
00:26:22,450 --> 00:26:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My brave and mighty general,</font></font>

410
00:26:26,630 --> 00:26:27,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">am I doing it right?</font></font>

411
00:26:30,020 --> 00:26:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Old dreams fade with the rain. Why seek shelter elsewhere?♪</font></font>

412
00:26:36,580 --> 00:26:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪With you beside me, all is well♪</font></font>

413
00:26:44,580 --> 00:26:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Songyue Hall]</font></font>

414
00:26:52,390 --> 00:26:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness, Hongxian has sent a secret message.</font></font>

415
00:26:54,280 --> 00:26:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty fell from his horse while hunting and was badly injured.</font></font>

416
00:26:55,760 --> 00:26:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She asks you to enter the palace at once.</font></font>

417
00:27:14,830 --> 00:27:15,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty.</font></font>

418
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:17,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty.</font></font>

419
00:27:19,150 --> 00:27:19,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty.</font></font>

420
00:27:24,310 --> 00:27:25,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty.</font></font>

421
00:27:37,910 --> 00:27:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao,</font></font>

422
00:27:39,630 --> 00:27:40,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're here.</font></font>

423
00:27:41,560 --> 00:27:43,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mother cried so hard she fainted.</font></font>

424
00:27:43,830 --> 00:27:46,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've had her taken back to her palace to rest.</font></font>

425
00:27:46,800 --> 00:27:49,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty has been waiting for you.</font></font>

426
00:27:51,070 --> 00:27:52,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was getting late,</font></font>

427
00:27:52,560 --> 00:27:53,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the weather in the mountains turned.</font></font>

428
00:27:54,670 --> 00:27:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I advised His Majesty to return,</font></font>

429
00:27:55,700 --> 00:27:56,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but he insisted on hunting down that wild fox.</font></font>

430
00:27:57,670 --> 00:27:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then we encountered a bear.</font></font>

431
00:27:59,480 --> 00:28:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who knew there would be a bear there?</font></font>

432
00:28:01,520 --> 00:28:02,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It suddenly charged at us</font></font>

433
00:28:02,320 --> 00:28:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and killed two guards.</font></font>

434
00:28:03,150 --> 00:28:03,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty...</font></font>

435
00:28:03,630 --> 00:28:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty needs to rest.</font></font>

436
00:28:06,240 --> 00:28:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please leave, Prince Fu.</font></font>

437
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:25,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was him.</font></font>

438
00:28:25,960 --> 00:28:27,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was him!</font></font>

439
00:28:28,630 --> 00:28:31,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He led His Majesty into those woods.</font></font>

440
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:33,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty had just ordered him to leave for his fief,</font></font>

441
00:28:34,320 --> 00:28:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and then this happened.</font></font>

442
00:28:35,960 --> 00:28:36,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao,</font></font>

443
00:28:37,870 --> 00:28:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he's the culprit.</font></font>

444
00:28:41,320 --> 00:28:42,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao.</font></font>

445
00:28:43,280 --> 00:28:44,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm here.</font></font>

446
00:28:45,320 --> 00:28:46,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you want to say?</font></font>

447
00:28:47,240 --> 00:28:49,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When Father died,</font></font>

448
00:28:50,200 --> 00:28:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he told me to be kind</font></font>

449
00:28:52,320 --> 00:28:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to my only remaining brother.</font></font>

450
00:28:55,200 --> 00:28:58,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Though you urged me time and again to kill him,</font></font>

451
00:28:59,150 --> 00:29:01,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I always showed him leniency.</font></font>

452
00:29:02,320 --> 00:29:03,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know.</font></font>

453
00:29:04,040 --> 00:29:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know you did.</font></font>

454
00:29:06,200 --> 00:29:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For three years,</font></font>

455
00:29:08,520 --> 00:29:10,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he was cautious</font></font>

456
00:29:11,280 --> 00:29:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and respectful in every way.</font></font>

457
00:29:13,280 --> 00:29:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But all along,</font></font>

458
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:16,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he was lying low,</font></font>

459
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:18,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">waiting for his chance.</font></font>

460
00:29:19,760 --> 00:29:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tomorrow</font></font>

461
00:29:21,430 --> 00:29:23,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is the day the regional princes</font></font>

462
00:29:23,960 --> 00:29:27,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">come to the capital for their audience, once every three years.</font></font>

463
00:29:30,110 --> 00:29:30,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stop talking.</font></font>

464
00:29:31,670 --> 00:29:32,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You need to rest.</font></font>

465
00:29:34,040 --> 00:29:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty...</font></font>

466
00:29:36,570 --> 00:29:38,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shuo...</font></font>

467
00:29:40,150 --> 00:29:41,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty...</font></font>

468
00:29:43,070 --> 00:29:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought</font></font>

469
00:29:45,110 --> 00:29:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd live to 100</font></font>

470
00:29:48,320 --> 00:29:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and have time to become a good emperor,</font></font>

471
00:29:51,800 --> 00:29:53,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to work with you</font></font>

472
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:55,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and bring about an age</font></font>

473
00:29:57,200 --> 00:29:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of peace and prosperity.</font></font>

474
00:30:00,830 --> 00:30:02,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I never thought...</font></font>

475
00:30:05,150 --> 00:30:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I never thought</font></font>

476
00:30:07,560 --> 00:30:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't live</font></font>

477
00:30:10,040 --> 00:30:11,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to see tomorrow's dawn.</font></font>

478
00:30:14,430 --> 00:30:15,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty...</font></font>

479
00:30:15,240 --> 00:30:16,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao.</font></font>

480
00:30:16,320 --> 00:30:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm here.</font></font>

481
00:30:17,140 --> 00:30:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao.</font></font>

482
00:30:17,870 --> 00:30:19,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm here.</font></font>

483
00:30:21,320 --> 00:30:21,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

484
00:30:23,760 --> 00:30:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm so afraid.</font></font>

485
00:30:26,110 --> 00:30:26,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't be afraid.</font></font>

486
00:30:27,720 --> 00:30:29,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm here. Don't be afraid, Shuo.</font></font>

487
00:30:31,480 --> 00:30:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's not fair.</font></font>

488
00:30:34,040 --> 00:30:35,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's not fair.</font></font>

489
00:30:54,870 --> 00:30:55,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shuo.</font></font>

490
00:30:57,560 --> 00:30:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty...</font></font>

491
00:30:58,910 --> 00:30:59,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shuo.</font></font>

492
00:31:05,110 --> 00:31:09,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shuo!</font></font>

493
00:31:10,080 --> 00:31:10,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty!</font></font>

494
00:31:13,630 --> 00:31:14,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty!</font></font>

495
00:31:17,760 --> 00:31:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What ominous signs?</font></font>

496
00:31:19,390 --> 00:31:20,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't I succeed?</font></font>

497
00:31:20,760 --> 00:31:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I'd known,</font></font>

498
00:31:21,720 --> 00:31:22,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wouldn't have waited three years.</font></font>

499
00:31:23,320 --> 00:31:24,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was all just a woman's foolish fears.</font></font>

500
00:31:24,870 --> 00:31:26,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I should've made my move long ago.</font></font>

501
00:31:31,760 --> 00:31:32,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo, what are you doing?</font></font>

502
00:31:33,430 --> 00:31:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">These are the imperial palace grounds!</font></font>

503
00:31:34,800 --> 00:31:36,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How dare you act so lawlessly here?</font></font>

504
00:31:37,430 --> 00:31:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Seize him.</font></font>

505
00:31:41,910 --> 00:31:42,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo,</font></font>

506
00:31:43,110 --> 00:31:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm the late Emperor's son.</font></font>

507
00:31:45,590 --> 00:31:46,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can't kill me.</font></font>

508
00:31:47,870 --> 00:31:49,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to see the Grand Empress Dowager!</font></font>

509
00:31:49,960 --> 00:31:51,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to see the Grand Empress Dowager!</font></font>

510
00:31:52,150 --> 00:31:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If the Princess Protector of the Realm wants you dead,</font></font>

511
00:31:54,760 --> 00:31:56,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you must have committed an unforgivable crime.</font></font>

512
00:31:57,800 --> 00:31:59,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You won't see the Grand Empress Dowager.</font></font>

513
00:32:05,150 --> 00:32:05,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My Lord,</font></font>

514
00:32:06,480 --> 00:32:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Prince Rong and 13 other regional princes</font></font>

515
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have arrived in the capital.</font></font>

516
00:32:09,280 --> 00:32:11,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Grand Empress Dowager has prepared a grand banquet</font></font>

517
00:32:11,280 --> 00:32:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to welcome them.</font></font>

518
00:32:13,150 --> 00:32:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Prince Fu</font></font>

519
00:32:14,800 --> 00:32:15,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is the guest of honor.</font></font>

520
00:32:22,870 --> 00:32:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It seems they've already chosen the next emperor.</font></font>

521
00:32:26,910 --> 00:32:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Poor Shuo.</font></font>

522
00:32:31,110 --> 00:32:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How despicable they are!</font></font>

523
00:32:33,280 --> 00:32:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go.</font></font>

524
00:32:35,760 --> 00:32:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To Xuanshi Palace.</font></font>

525
00:32:37,180 --> 00:32:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Baihu Hall]</font></font>

526
00:32:45,320 --> 00:32:46,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's over.</font></font>

527
00:32:47,830 --> 00:32:49,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's all over.</font></font>

528
00:32:50,580 --> 00:32:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The princes will enter the palace tomorrow.</font></font>

529
00:32:52,760 --> 00:32:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With His Majesty dead,</font></font>

530
00:32:54,390 --> 00:32:56,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the realm will fall into chaos.</font></font>

531
00:32:57,040 --> 00:32:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Of the late Emperor's sons,</font></font>

532
00:32:58,910 --> 00:33:00,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">only Prince Fu remains.</font></font>

533
00:33:00,290 --> 00:33:02,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Prince Fu is dead!</font></font>

534
00:33:05,830 --> 00:33:07,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty loved his brother</font></font>

535
00:33:08,960 --> 00:33:11,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and chose him to join him in death.</font></font>

536
00:33:18,560 --> 00:33:19,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">By now,</font></font>

537
00:33:21,800 --> 00:33:23,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he's followed His Majesty</font></font>

538
00:33:24,390 --> 00:33:25,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to the underworld.</font></font>

539
00:33:29,520 --> 00:33:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But</font></font>

540
00:33:31,870 --> 00:33:33,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Prince Rong is still alive.</font></font>

541
00:33:34,430 --> 00:33:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Grand Empress Dowager</font></font>

542
00:33:35,560 --> 00:33:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will surely put her youngest son on the throne.</font></font>

543
00:33:39,110 --> 00:33:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once he takes the throne,</font></font>

544
00:33:41,070 --> 00:33:43,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the Empress Dowager,</font></font>

545
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:46,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you, the Princess Protector of the Realm, and I</font></font>

546
00:33:46,280 --> 00:33:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will all be doomed.</font></font>

547
00:33:57,800 --> 00:33:59,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh, Heaven.</font></font>

548
00:34:01,870 --> 00:34:03,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

549
00:34:05,480 --> 00:34:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

550
00:34:09,120 --> 00:34:11,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why, whenever I think</font></font>

551
00:34:11,090 --> 00:34:12,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">things are finally getting better,</font></font>

552
00:34:13,950 --> 00:34:16,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">do you cast me back into the abyss,</font></font>

553
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:19,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">driving me</font></font>

554
00:34:21,430 --> 00:34:26,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">into despair again and again?</font></font>

555
00:34:31,760 --> 00:34:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How much more will you torment me?</font></font>

556
00:34:34,760 --> 00:34:38,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How much must I suffer before you're satisfied?</font></font>

557
00:34:40,470 --> 00:34:41,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

558
00:34:44,030 --> 00:34:46,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

559
00:34:47,240 --> 00:34:48,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shuo!</font></font>

560
00:34:49,430 --> 00:34:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shuo!</font></font>

561
00:34:55,760 --> 00:34:56,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao.</font></font>

562
00:35:18,620 --> 00:35:21,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪See the price paid in blood♪</font></font>

563
00:35:21,500 --> 00:35:24,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Binding half a lifetime of fate♪</font></font>

564
00:35:24,500 --> 00:35:26,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Watch her tear apart with her own hands♪</font></font>

565
00:35:26,940 --> 00:35:29,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The cold haze of a humble life♪</font></font>

566
00:35:30,300 --> 00:35:32,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Trading it for robes of splendor♪</font></font>

567
00:35:32,180 --> 00:35:33,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Every step is on a blade♪</font></font>

568
00:35:34,020 --> 00:35:35,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪To the eyes of the world♪</font></font>

569
00:35:35,860 --> 00:35:38,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She's a bird, a flower, a plaything♪</font></font>

570
00:35:38,620 --> 00:35:41,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪But with one sweep she scatters the clouds...♪</font></font>

571
00:35:42,990 --> 00:35:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Open the doors</font></font>

572
00:35:45,910 --> 00:35:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and all the windows.</font></font>

573
00:35:47,660 --> 00:35:50,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪A game within a game, a fate beyond fate♪</font></font>

574
00:35:50,580 --> 00:35:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Who makes the move? Who listens?♪</font></font>

575
00:36:00,140 --> 00:36:01,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Behind this mask♪</font></font>

576
00:36:01,940 --> 00:36:03,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She plays out every soul♪</font></font>

577
00:36:03,500 --> 00:36:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Each encounter and each step fraught with danger...♪</font></font>

578
00:36:06,390 --> 00:36:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Issue my orders.</font></font>

579
00:36:07,780 --> 00:36:09,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Burn away these chains...♪</font></font>

580
00:36:09,760 --> 00:36:11,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty has passed away.</font></font>

581
00:36:12,470 --> 00:36:14,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Grand Empress Dowager is in mourning</font></font>

582
00:36:15,990 --> 00:36:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and should not receive the regional princes.</font></font>

583
00:36:18,640 --> 00:36:21,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Stir up a mighty storm...♪</font></font>

584
00:36:21,150 --> 00:36:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As Princess Protector of the Realm,</font></font>

585
00:36:25,870 --> 00:36:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I shall receive them instead.</font></font>

586
00:36:35,460 --> 00:36:37,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Hearts turn cold, blades turn colder♪</font></font>

587
00:36:37,500 --> 00:36:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪A game within a game, who waits?♪</font></font>

588
00:36:41,100 --> 00:36:43,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That night deep within the estate♪</font></font>

589
00:36:43,900 --> 00:36:47,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She dares to challenge fate♪</font></font>

590
00:36:53,260 --> 00:36:55,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪See the snowstorms at the frontier♪</font></font>

591
00:36:55,420 --> 00:36:58,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Sweep over all those gilded lies, ah♪</font></font>

592
00:36:59,100 --> 00:37:00,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Cast off her bridal robes, even if♪</font></font>

593
00:37:00,780 --> 00:37:03,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She burns into a wildfire across the wasteland♪</font></font>

594
00:37:04,140 --> 00:37:11,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Together we'll guard this beloved, splendid world♪</font></font>

595
00:37:12,340 --> 00:37:13,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Behind this mask♪</font></font>

596
00:37:14,140 --> 00:37:15,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She plays out every soul♪</font></font>

597
00:37:15,780 --> 00:37:17,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Each encounter and each step fraught with danger♪</font></font>

598
00:37:18,340 --> 00:37:19,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Set a wild fire ablaze♪</font></font>

599
00:37:19,940 --> 00:37:21,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Burn away these chains♪</font></font>

600
00:37:21,460 --> 00:37:24,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Let this frost flower fulfill its fate♪</font></font>

601
00:37:24,420 --> 00:37:25,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Take a single chess piece♪</font></font>

602
00:37:25,940 --> 00:37:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And wager heaven and earth♪</font></font>

603
00:37:27,180 --> 00:37:29,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Xuanshi Palace]</font></font>

604
00:37:30,580 --> 00:37:33,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Stir up a mighty storm...♪</font></font>

605
00:37:33,900 --> 00:37:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Xuanshi Palace]</font></font>

606
00:37:36,200 --> 00:37:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whatever trials and disasters may befall me,</font></font>

607
00:37:40,600 --> 00:37:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll overcome them all.</font></font>

608
00:37:43,950 --> 00:37:46,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll find a way to make them submit.</font></font>

609
00:37:48,160 --> 00:37:50,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everything will get better,</font></font>

610
00:37:52,550 --> 00:37:54,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">as long as I live.</font></font>

611
00:37:56,470 --> 00:37:58,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as I live.</font></font>

612
00:38:24,300 --> 00:38:29,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The candlelight suddenly chills the window♪</font></font>

613
00:38:30,900 --> 00:38:37,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Whose shadow stirs the ripples in another's heart?♪</font></font>

614
00:38:38,260 --> 00:38:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That sigh is soft yet thunders like a drum♪</font></font>

615
00:38:45,540 --> 00:38:52,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And leaves the world around us strangely still♪</font></font>

616
00:38:53,060 --> 00:38:58,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I've grown used to walking through the cold♪</font></font>

617
00:39:00,060 --> 00:39:06,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I've seen the broken shadows beneath all the splendor♪</font></font>

618
00:39:07,340 --> 00:39:13,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪But like the wind you stir the calm within my eyes♪</font></font>

619
00:39:14,620 --> 00:39:21,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Until this game of testing has no winner or loser♪</font></font>

620
00:39:21,780 --> 00:39:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪We're so close I forget how to breathe♪</font></font>

621
00:39:29,900 --> 00:39:36,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Your gaze is like fire flickering yet searing my secrets♪</font></font>

622
00:39:37,220 --> 00:39:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The sharpness I've hidden inside my weakness♪</font></font>

623
00:39:42,700 --> 00:39:50,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Scatters into disarray the moment you lean close♪</font></font>

624
00:39:50,820 --> 00:39:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪We're so close I hear my heartbeat break free♪</font></font>

625
00:39:59,020 --> 00:40:05,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Who lost their plan and who lost their breath in this moment?♪</font></font>

626
00:40:06,300 --> 00:40:11,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Even if you'll still be far beyond my reach♪</font></font>

627
00:40:11,860 --> 00:40:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪At least right now there's only an inch between us♪</font></font>
